{"id": "70322", "title": "我从不曾说爱你", "author": "谢楼南", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 40, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70322/70322s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70322.htm", "intro": "他们的相遇，如同所有寻常的都市男女。\n    一次街角的偶遇，一个无心的温暖微笑，就足以慰藉彼此孤单的心灵。\n    他们的婚姻，如同所有陷入猜忌的爱情围城。\n    一个疏忽的过失，一句冷漠的凉薄话语，已经足够冰封所有美好的过往。\n    她以为他们不过是又一对以悲剧结尾的怨偶。\n    他却带来惊涛骇浪般的过去，黑暗中唯一的光明就是彼此。\n    当注定走过所有的悲伤，他们才能再次相拥。\n    当深爱对方，成为不需说出的默契。\n    是他让她明白——\n    有一种人，注定一生无爱，却会比任何人都爱你。\n    有一种人，只有失去，才知道美如星辰，只是仰望，就已沉醉。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70322", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "实体书上市通知", "file": "10928834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "10928835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章", "file": "10928836.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "10928837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "10928838.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章（上）", "file": "10928839.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章（下）", "file": "10928840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章（上）", "file": "10928841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章（中）", "file": "10928842.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章（下）", "file": "10928843.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章（上）", "file": "10928844.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章（中）", "file": "10928845.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章（下）", "file": "10928846.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章（上）", "file": "10928847.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章（中）", "file": "10928848.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章（下）", "file": "10928849.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章（上）", "file": "10928850.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章（中）", "file": "10928851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章（下）", "file": "10928852.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章（上）", "file": "10928853.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章（中）", "file": "10928854.html", "available": false}, {"ti